## 2. PROJECT IDENTITY

Business name: GlowHauz Skincare and Wellness Store

Brand positioning: "Where Skin Meets Science."

Website type: Premium beauty, skincare, personal care, and wellness e-commerce storefront.

Primary market: Nigeria, including Enugu and other locations the business serves.

Currency: Nigerian naira (NGN / ₦).

Primary conversion action: Customers browse products, add products to a cart, review their selection, and submit their intended order through WhatsApp.

Official WhatsApp number supplied by the business: 07089581351.

For WhatsApp URL generation, normalize this Nigerian number to the appropriate international recipient format, normally 2347089581351. Validate the number and store it in an editable business setting.

Business model:
- Customers can browse and compare products.
- Customers can view product details, prices, sizes, variants, and availability.
- Customers can add multiple products to a cart.
- Customers can review quantities and totals.
